    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... it's never just a \"setback.\" it's the same shame, the same gut-wrenching regret, every single time. i'm so sick of \"regrouping.\" i'm just tired of existing in this loop where i'm constantly broken. it feels like i'm just delaying the inevitable. what's the point of trying to fix something that's just gonna break again?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
